  "remarks": "In detention in Algeria as of November 2023. Sentenced to 18 years imprisonment for conducting terrorist activities by the Algiers Criminal Court on 25 January 2023. Arrest warrant issued by the German authorities on 9 Oct. 2003 and 18 July 2018 respectively for involvement in kidnapping, robbery and extortion. Former member of the Katibat Tarek Ibn Ziad of The Organization of Al Qaida in the Islamic Maghreb (QDe.014). Father’s name: Sliman. Mother’s name Oum Hani Djermane INTERPOL-UN Security Council Special Notice:https://www.interpol.int/en/How-we-work/Notices/View-UN-Notices-Individuals",
